# Public repo — WHITELIST: track ONLY the schematic, PCB, project file, and the
# custom footprint library. Everything else stays OUT of version control:
# .history/, wombat2-backups/, outputs/, *.lib symbol libs, fp-lib-table, and
# *.kicad_prl (local UI state). Ignore all, then re-include the deliverables.
*
!.gitignore
!wombat2.kicad_sch
!wombat2.kicad_pcb
!wombat2.kicad_pro
# custom footprints (re-include the dir, then only the footprint files in it)
!Library.pretty/
!Library.pretty/*.kicad_mod
